  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2205.04 License Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2205.04 License Fees. Pursuant to RSA 106-F:8, the following fees shall be collected upon making application for:\n\n(a) Private investigator individual license, security guard individual license, or bail recovery individual license, $150.00;\n\n(b) Private investigative agency license, security guard agency license or bail recovery agency license, $350.00; and\n\n(c) Employee, $5.00.\n\nSource. #9484 eff 6-19-09; ss by #12513, eff 4-12-18; amd by #13138, eff 11-24-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2200.html"
